1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,891
The Danish Gambit trades pawns for open diagonals.

2
00:00:03,971 --> 00:00:07,863
White hits the center before Black can develop.

3
00:00:07,943 --> 00:00:11,834
The second pawn is offered as another piece of bait.

4
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:15,806
Black takes, but White's bishops wake up instantly.

5
00:00:15,886 --> 00:00:19,777
The bishop recaptures and keeps every line pointed forward.

6
00:00:19,857 --> 00:00:23,749
White develops again while Black spends time on defense.

7
00:00:23,829 --> 00:00:27,720
The lesson: activity is the compensation for sacrificed pawns.
